// Radio component - unified field: single radio if 1 choice, radio group if > 1
[fmdb:radio] > jnt:content, fmdbmix:element, fmdbmix:choiceField, fmdbmix:validationMessages
 - helpText (string, richtext[ckeditor.toolbar='FormidableHelp',ckeditor.customConfig='$context/modules/formidable-engine/javascript/ckeditor/helpTextConfig.js']) i18n indexed=no
 - choices (string) i18n multiple indexed=no mandatory
 - required (boolean) = false
